            "review_title": "Review at Va Thanh",
            "review_text": "Minh tri T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam106 contributions\n0\nDelicious Taiwan food\nNov 2021 • Friends\nThat is great taste with chef from Taiwan . You can order one or many foods to try together with your friends . Nice atmosphere with air conditioner . I tried many places but this time I feel is wonderful to taste . If you can not read Taiwanese that you can ask menu to choose a,b,c aphabet on menu or you can ask waiter for helping . You guys should try it .\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 24, 2021",
