            "review_title": "Review at Va Thanh",
            "review_text": "Darren\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nSimply the best Taiwanese food in Saigon\nMar 2020\nI lived in Taipei for almost 2 years, and Va Thanh is where I go to re-experience all those great food memories... from the value-terrific set meals, to my favorite, dumplings and sweet and sour soup. The restaurant is clean, cool, and comfortable to dine in. Great service. There's even Taiwanese news playing 24/7 in the background too! You'll get the full authentically Taiwan experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 4, 2020\nChung C\nThank you for the high praises! We are glad that you enjoyed our dine in experience. During this confinement period, please feel free to call us for delivery.\nRead more\nWritten April 7, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
