            "review_title": "Review at Va Thanh",
            "review_text": "ML2011\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam94 contributions\n0\nLoved it\nJan 2019 • Family\nTraditional home style family cooking. So happy to find such a place in Saigon. We ordered the beef noodle soup, the egg rolls, the boiled dumplings and we were already feeling in Taiwan!\nThe owner’s son speaks French and English, making it easy to ask and order.\nWill come back!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 10, 2019\nChung C\nThank you for your review! Hope to see you again soon!\nWritten September 25, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
