            "review_title": "Review at Va Thanh",
            "review_text": "Kevin\n5 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Taiwanese Home Cooking\nDec 2018 • Friends\nIf you are looking for home cooking meals, this is where you go. The beef noodle soup and the pan-fried dumplings are to kill for! My friend had fried chicken rice and the scallion pancake, and we were both happy to have found this place.\nPrice is very affordable, around 300,000VND in total.\nWe might turn this into our cantine on a daily basis whenever you crave for home cooking meals.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 7, 2019",
